wip/py-csvw: Import py-csvw-4.2.0

Python implementation of the W3C "CSV on the Web" recommendations.
csvw asks for rfc3986<2, but the URIReference and normalize_uri API it
uses is unchanged in www/py-rfc3986 2.0, so depend on that.  The
scripts get a ${PYVERSSUFFIX} suffix.  Needed by segments
(wip/py-segments).
